{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261103/photo/bkn-20261103100138265-1103_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261103101355\"/><p>運輸署今日（11月3日）上午約8時20分，接獲營運商報告咪錶泊車系統出現故障，現正緊急搶修。署方已責成營運商從速跟進修復工作，將對駕駛人士的影響減至最低，並徹查事故原因及提交報告。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T02:22:02.083196+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:01:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T02:19:11.595029+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T02:19:11.595029+00:00","content_hash":"85c1cddd540b0bc62211b798a381151736a6af0451eee594e7d7ccd4de15eddb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}